Implementation notes: Minecraft truncates `latest.log` on every launch, so the watcher tracks file size and re-seeks when it shrinks — otherwise the tail would sit past EOF forever after a game restart. Death detection matches on verb fragments (longest-first, so "was killed by magic" isn't swallowed by "was killed by") since the subject is your username and the object varies. Counters roll over at midnight like the Valorant W/L does.

